# The roof underfoot cut off when VDP1 runs out of time (the user, 2026-11-15, a gif at 0660: fps
# 30, vdp1 over 30, busy 100%, the roof drawn only in part). Stood on 0660, then running west across
# 0650 to 0640 between the tall towers: Mednafen reads vdp1 over 14 (busy 83%) at 0650 and over 3 at
# 0640, cpu peaks ~200%. Standing still in a roof's middle (the benchmark's views) reads over 0.
# Every frame recorded, a shot every quarter second. Read the last shot's "vdp1 over N/T": T is every
# frame VDP1 didn't finish since boot. 2026-11-15: 16 with DRAW_BUDGET 0, 3 with it on (SG-8)
record
boot_at 0660
wait_up
wait 2.0
shot r660_00
flashes_from
keydown up
wait 0.25
shot r660_01
wait 0.25
shot r660_02
wait 0.25
shot r660_03
wait 0.25
shot r660_04
wait 0.25
shot r660_05
wait 0.25
shot r660_06
wait 0.25
shot r660_07
wait 0.25
shot r660_08
wait 0.25
shot r660_09
wait 0.25
shot r660_10
wait 0.25
shot r660_11
wait 0.25
shot r660_12
keyup up
wait 1.5
flashes_to roof_0660
shot r660_99_stopped
